      "story_id": 1,
      "headline": "Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro-Vorcaro 'Dark Horse' film scandal dominates week, triggering PF investigation, polls shift, and PT digital offensive",
      "summary": "Intercept Brasil published audio recordings in which Senator Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro (PL-RJ), the leading opposition presidential candidate, negotiated R$134 million in financing from imprisoned banker Daniel Vorcaro (Banco Master) for the biographical film 'Dark Horse' about Jair Bolsonaro. The revelations expanded to include Eduardo Bolsonaro's role as executive producer, a Texas offshore fund (Havengate) under PF investigation, STF scrutiny of parliamentary amendments tied to the film's production company, and a broader crisis involving Fl\u00e1vio's candidacy viability. PT launched an aggressive digital campaign exploiting the scandal while Lula publicly mocked the affair. Reaction figures including Tarc\u00edsio, Zema, Moro, and Carlos Bolsonaro weighed in.",
